@startuml WF-00_end_to_end_overview
' ============================================================
' WF-00 - End-to-end overview (context diagram for WF-01..WF-06, not a main workflow itself)
' Main entity: Order Group  awaiting_packaging -> picking -> picked -> pending_approval
'              -> approved_for_packing -> packed -> shipped -> delivered | returned
' ============================================================
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BFA76A
skinparam TitleFontSize 16

title OptiPack AI - End-to-End Fulfillment Overview

|Customer|
|Marketplace (Lazada / AURELLE)|
|OptiPack System|
|Warehouse Staff|
|Packaging Staff|
|Shipping Coordinator|
|GHN (Carrier)|

|Warehouse Staff|
start
:Receive stock by lot into bins
**[WF-06]**;
|Customer|
:Place order;
|Marketplace (Lazada / AURELLE)|
:Record order
(AURELLE: webhook, Lazada: polled);
|OptiPack System|
:Import order, consolidate into group,
reserve stock, assign picker
**[WF-01]**;
|Warehouse Staff|
:Pick items by bin and lot
**[WF-02]**;
|OptiPack System|
:Compute 3D packing plan **[WF-03]**;
|Packaging Staff|
:Approve plan, scan and seal parcels
**[WF-03]**;
|Shipping Coordinator|
:Choose carrier and create shipment
**[WF-04]**;
|GHN (Carrier)|
:Pick up and deliver parcels **[WF-04]**;
if (Delivered?) then (yes)
  |Customer|
  :Receive order;
  if (Request return / exchange
  within 15 days?) then (yes)
    :Submit request on AURELLE
    **[WF-05]**;
    |Warehouse Staff|
    :Receive and inspect returned items
    **[WF-05]**;
  else (no)
  endif
else (no)
  |GHN (Carrier)|
  :Return parcels to warehouse
  **[WF-04]**;
  |Warehouse Staff|
  :Receive and inspect returned parcels
  **[WF-05]**;
endif
|OptiPack System|
:Send status changes back to AURELLE
(customer tracking page; Lazada is not written back);
stop
@enduml
